            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存したレシピ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saves depth with the photo to shape the surface. Constant Color and RAW are not used for depth photos.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写真と一緒に深度を保存し、表面の形状に使います。深度付きの写真ではConstant ColorとRAWは使われません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saves or shares the PBR maps with glTF, USDZ, Unreal, Unity and other formats": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PBRマップをglTF、USDZ、Unreal、Unityなどの形式で保存または共有します"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saves the PBR maps with glTF, USDZ, Unreal, Unity and other formats to Files": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PBRマップをglTF、USDZ、Unreal、Unityなどの形式とともに「ファイル」に保存します"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan Mac QR": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MacのQRを読み取る"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan Pairing QR": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ペアリングQRを読み取る"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Seam checks are diagnostics, not automatic tileability approval.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "継ぎ目のチェックは診断用で、タイル化の可否を自動で判定するものではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Seam method": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "継ぎ目の処理方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send to Mac needs a pairing QR from Material Lab. Files and AirDrop work too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「Macに送信」にはMaterial LabのペアリングQRが必要です。「ファイル」やAirDropでも送れます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send to Paired Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ペアリング済みのMacに送信"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Separate base colour, normal, roughness, occlusion, metallic and height maps.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ベースカラー、ノーマル、ラフネス、オクルージョン、メタリック、高さの個別マップ。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shape": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "形状"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shapes the surface from the depth measured with this photo, at its real depth. With learned geometry on as well, LiDAR gives the large-scale form and learned geometry the finer detail.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この写真と一緒に計測した深度から、実際の深さで表面の形状を作ります。学習ジオメトリもオンの場合は、大きな形状をLiDARが、細かなディテールを学習ジオメトリが担当します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shares the bundle or one format with AirDrop, Mail, Messages or another app": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "バンドルまたは1つの形式をAirDrop、メール、メッセージ、ほかのアプリで共有します"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Share…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "共有…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sharing sends folders, such as the .pbrmaterial bundle, as .zip archives. Save to Files keeps them as folders.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "共有では、.pbrmaterialバンドルなどのフォルダを.zipアーカイブとして送ります。“ファイル”に保存するとフォルダのまま保存されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show All Materials": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すべてのマテリアルを表示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
