    "Tile size": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "タイルの実寸"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tile size is the real width of the surface in the photo (0 = unknown, treated as 1 m), so relief is sized physically. Mid-scale relief keeps seams, chips and fasteners readable from a few metres away. Follow colour limits how far roughness tracks brightness, so dark paint does not read as rough.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "タイルの実寸は写真に写っている面の実際の幅です(0は不明で、1 mとして扱います)。凹凸を実寸に合わせます。中スケールの凹凸は、継ぎ目・欠け・留め具が数メートル離れても読み取れるようにします。色への追従は、ラフネスが明るさに追従する度合いを制限し、暗い塗装が粗く見えるのを防ぎます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tiled": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
